# Article III.

## other provisions

3.1 Nature of Grant. In accepting the DSUs, Participant understands, acknowledges, and agrees that:

(a) the Plan is established voluntarily by the Company, it is discretionary in nature and it may be modified, amended, suspended or terminated by the Company at any time in accordance with its terms;

(b) all decisions with respect to future DSU or other grants, if any, will be at the sole discretion of the Administrator;

(c) nothing in the Plan or this Agreement shall in any way be construed or interpreted to adversely affect or otherwise impair the right of the Company or its stockholders to remove Participant from the Board at any time in accordance with the provisions of applicable law;

(d) Participant is voluntarily participating in the Plan;

certainty;

